<p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/05JR">Corollary <span data-tag="05JR">8.6.6.3</span>.</a> For every simplicial set $\operatorname{\mathcal{C}}$, the formation of cartesian conjugates induces a bijection </p>
<div class="equation">
  \[ \xymatrix@C =50pt@R=50pt{ \{  \textnormal{Cocartesian fibrations $U: \operatorname{\mathcal{E}}\rightarrow \operatorname{\mathcal{C}}$} \}  / \textnormal{Equivalence} \ar [d] \\ \{  \textnormal{Cartesian fibrations $U^{\dagger }: \operatorname{\mathcal{E}}^{\dagger } \rightarrow \operatorname{\mathcal{C}}^{\operatorname{op}}$} \}  / \textnormal{Equivalence.} } \]
</div>
</article><article class="env-proof">
<p>
<strong>Proof.</strong>
      Combine Proposition <a data-tag="04EU" href="/tag/04EU">8.6.6.1</a> with Corollary <a data-tag="04DU" href="/tag/04DU">8.6.5.2</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
</p>
</article>
